{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063904/block/singleImage/3267834/df/01M7FJ2Z6234P7HHGHB4QF6TGG.jpg?updatedAt=1794744988\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位起火。</figcaption></figure><p>黃大仙下邨龍光樓今早(15日)發生奪命火警，一名八旬婦當場身亡。至傍晚約6時許，警方再接獲報案，指同邨的龍和樓亦有單位起火，消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救。</p><p>火警中約有100位人疏散至安全位置，涉事單位住戶疑吸入濃煙不適，需要戴上氧氣罩。據了解，起火原因疑是煮食時廚房起火。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T13:41:50.957903+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T12:16:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:32.783162+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T13:35:17.290195+00:00","content_hash":"cad4e99dafc71dd3ed5e28e35ecf401c2703a335a089c65e600b73b13aec24ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T13:41:50.957903+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}